@HostAddress = http://localhost:5031

### 1. Get Weather Forecast (Public endpoint)
GET {{HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Access protected test endpoint without token (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/test/secure
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Log in as Anna (Should return 200 OK with a valid JWT token)
# @name loginAnna
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Save token from loginAnna response
@authToken = {{loginAnna.response.body.token}}

### 4. Access protected endpoint with valid JWT token (Should return 200 OK and show claims)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/test/secure
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Log in with wrong credentials (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 6. CORS Preflight OPTIONS request from React Vite frontend (Should return 204/200 with Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
OPTIONS {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization, content-type


